WEBVTT

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:54.500
Who are you guys?

00:03:55.340 --> 00:03:57.100
Don't come near me, damn it!

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:15.420
For crying out loud... what a mess.

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:19.850
When we were surrounded by that crowd,
I wondered what would happen to us.

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:25.030
Earlier, I heard many of them
saying, "Baksheesh..."

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:26.970
But, what does that mean?

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:29.100
It means, "Give me money."

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:32.100
Makes sense...

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:36.640
Anyway, this is one
hell of a place, isn't it?

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:38.710
Polnareff...

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:42.610
once you get used to it, you'll understand
the goodness and depth of this country.

00:04:43.350 --> 00:04:45.840
No way I'm going to get
used to a place like this.

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:48.610
But this "chai," you call it?

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:51.130
This is pretty good!

00:04:52.030 --> 00:04:54.190
It's a pretty interesting country.

00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:55.860
I like it.

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:58.220
Are you serious, Jotaro?

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:01.090
You mean that?

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:04.910
Like the saying goes, "Once you
live in a place, it grows on you."

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:10.500
I don't get it.

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:13.910
You Asian guys have
no sense of beauty.

00:05:14.550 --> 00:05:15.920
Whatever...

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:18.710
I'm gonna go take a shit.

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:23.920
What a vulgar man.

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:25.220
Oh!

00:05:26.360 --> 00:05:27.520
Here come our meals.

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:29.570
Ah...

00:05:29.570 --> 00:05:31.030
They look delicious.

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:41.200
As I'd expect from a tourists' cafe...

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:43.010
the restroom is clean!

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:56.720
India... we're getting close.

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:16.810
N... no one!

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:18.910
My imagination...?

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:20.710
<i>I'm sure just n</i>o<i>w</i>

00:06:21.050 --> 00:06:23.710
<i>I saw a strange guy</i>
o<i>utside the wind</i>o<i>w</i>

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:39.930
<i>What? </i>

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:41.700
No way...!

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:45.300
It can't be...!

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:47.310
What is he!?

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:49.610
I can only see him in the mirror!?

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:52.920
T-that guy...!

00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:54.610
A right hand!

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:57.620
N-not good!

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:00.720
Bastard!

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:02.520
Silver Chariot!

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:13.000
Shit!

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:15.000
W-where is he!?

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:17.670
Where did he go...?

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:30.120
Where is the main body of that Stand?

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:36.720
Shit!

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:39.390
There's too many people...
I can't do anything!

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:44.890
What happened, Polnareff?

00:07:46.640 --> 00:07:47.900
At last, I found him!

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:48.630
It was him!

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:51.700
The bastard who killed my sister...

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:53.710
I found him!

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:57.010
Hold on, Polnareff!

00:07:57.550 --> 00:08:00.150
I understand how you feel,
but you should calm down!

00:08:00.150 --> 00:08:01.410
It could be an enemy trap!

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:02.910
Wait, you say?

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:06.810
You're telling me you can
understand my feelings?

00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:09.720
You really impress me, Avdol!

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:10.520
What?

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:12.590
My sister and I...

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:14.590
Iost our parents at an early age...

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:18.600
After that, we did our
best to live all on our own...

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:22.200
Then my sister was
violated, and murdered!

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:24.700
These feelings of mine...

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:28.280
You'll never understand them
unless you live through the same!

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:29.440
Not ever!

00:08:58.240 --> 00:08:59.000
Mr. Joestar...

00:08:59.940 --> 00:09:00.910
I hate to say this...

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:04.110
but I'm parting ways with all of you.

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:07.810
What do you mean, Polnareff?

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:13.920
Now that I know my
sister's assailant is nearby...

00:09:14.060 --> 00:09:16.120
I can't rest easy until I find him.

00:09:19.230 --> 00:09:23.100
Even though you don't know his
face, or the true nature of his Stand?

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:26.240
I know both of his
hands are right hands...

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:27.500
that's good enough for me.

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:31.600
"The tomb robber becomes the mummy."

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:33.400
What do you mean...?

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:35.510
You...

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:39.610
You think I'll be beaten by him?

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:44.520
I'm just saying it's dangerous to go up
against an unknown Stand all by yourself.

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:48.110
Avdol...

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:51.190
I heard that when you met Dio before...

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:53.590
you ran away because you were scared.

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:54.990
What!?

00:09:57.730 --> 00:09:59.790
I've been alone from the beginning.

00:10:00.940 --> 00:10:03.600
I've fought all alone until now.

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:07.240
Listen...

00:10:07.240 --> 00:10:09.010
I'll make this perfectly clear!

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:12.710
In the first place, I don't
care about that guy Dio.

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:17.410
I think I told you that I would go along
with you to seek my own vengeance!

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:18.640
Polnareff!

00:10:19.290 --> 00:10:20.810
Don't... Avdol!

00:10:21.460 --> 00:10:23.120
But, Mr. Joestar...

00:10:24.460 --> 00:10:26.620
It's okay... Let him go.

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:29.530
As I would have
expected, Mr. Joestar,

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:31.430
you're very understanding.

00:10:33.470 --> 00:10:34.830
Well... see you!

00:10:51.390 --> 00:10:53.860
We seem to have provoked him well.

00:10:54.190 --> 00:10:55.920
Right, Mr. J. Gail?

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:11.940
You...!

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:16.040
What happened yesterday?

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:17.940
I've been waiting for you a long time...

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:19.440
Hey, hey...

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:21.840
I didn't make any promises.

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:23.050
Oh, please!

00:11:23.590 --> 00:11:25.750
I want to stay with you for rest of my life!

00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:27.920
Don't be silly...

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:30.030
you're just sixteen.

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:31.590
But I'm old enough to marry.

00:11:32.660 --> 00:11:33.920
I love you!

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:35.120
Hey...

00:11:35.870 --> 00:11:37.920
I'm just a drifter.

00:11:38.070 --> 00:11:40.330
I live day to day...

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:42.830
and in the end, I'm
destined to die on the street.

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:46.540
Listen...

00:11:48.480 --> 00:11:51.240
You, who come from an
honorable, aristocratic family...

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:54.450
shouldn't even think
about marrying me.

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:57.950
Even if we do love each other...

00:11:58.990 --> 00:11:59.750
Really?

00:12:00.090 --> 00:12:03.120
You really love me?

00:12:04.260 --> 00:12:04.820
Yeah...

00:12:05.260 --> 00:12:07.230
In the whole world, only you.

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:10.630
So...

00:12:11.670 --> 00:12:15.540
Because I love you, I
shouldn't marry you.

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:17.740
You understand?

00:12:17.970 --> 00:12:21.340
It's heartbreakingly
difficult for me, you know...

00:12:21.680 --> 00:12:22.230
Yes...

00:12:22.980 --> 00:12:25.640
I'll hold you like this from time to time.

00:12:25.880 --> 00:12:28.350
That makes me happy enough.

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:29.450
Yes...

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:36.520
Well, you'd better go home.
Your parents must be worried.

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:38.290
Yes... I understand.

00:12:46.470 --> 00:12:48.530
That was an unexpected nuisance.

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:54.880
You're probably thinking that I'm
just complicating things again...

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:58.840
but it's convenient to have that
kind of woman all over the world.

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:00.950
They'll do anything for you...

00:13:01.180 --> 00:13:03.050
even sacrifice their lives.

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:07.350
You know the way I do things...

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:09.420
Right, Mr. J. Gail?

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:14.420
By the way, as we expected,
he's gone off on his own...

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:17.030
So, shall we kill Polnareff first?

00:13:17.170 --> 00:13:17.930
Yeah...

00:13:59.280 --> 00:14:01.440
Hey... Listen carefully.

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:05.450
When someone asks you if you've seen a
man whose hands are both right hands...

00:14:05.450 --> 00:14:08.310
you tell him you saw him on the
street towards the outskirts of town.

00:14:08.650 --> 00:14:10.810
Y-yes... of course.

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:17.920
First step completed...

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:35.140
The man has two right hands...

00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:36.540
I don't know.

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:37.340
Thanks.

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:10.400
Everything's ready, Mister...

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:16.870
Now we just wait for the
prey to step into our trap.

00:16:04.930 --> 00:16:06.090
Well, then...

00:16:12.540 --> 00:16:14.100
Shall we go?

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:16.510
With your Stand, "The Hanged Man..."

00:16:16.640 --> 00:16:18.580
and mine, "The Emperor," as partners...

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:20.580
we could kill them all!

00:16:46.340 --> 00:16:47.810
I've secured a vehicle.

00:16:48.140 --> 00:16:50.010
We can leave right away.

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:51.870
Well, shall we go...?

00:16:57.720 --> 00:16:58.780
Avdol-san...

00:17:13.230 --> 00:17:14.100
Avdol...

00:17:16.540 --> 00:17:17.400
Mr. Joestar...

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:20.240
Don't you think that our
enemy waited for a time...

00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:23.300
when Polnareff was alone
before showing up...?

00:17:23.840 --> 00:17:29.610
I... just can't stop thinking it
was a ploy to lure him away...

00:17:32.420 --> 00:17:33.180
Avdol...

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:36.110
I agree with what you're thinking...

00:17:38.630 --> 00:17:42.590
and we mustn't leave things as they are
when our comrade might be in danger...

00:17:43.430 --> 00:17:45.190
Now, let's get in the car...

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:47.100
and we'll follow him!

00:17:56.040 --> 00:17:56.940
What!?

00:17:56.940 --> 00:17:58.810
You saw him!? Are you sure?

00:17:58.810 --> 00:17:59.870
Y-yeah...

00:18:02.020 --> 00:18:05.280
You're sure you saw a man whose
hands were both right hands?

00:18:05.720 --> 00:18:06.620
Huh!?

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:07.280
Y-yeah...

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:08.780
Yes...

00:18:10.220 --> 00:18:11.090
Where!?

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:11.880
Uhhh...

00:18:12.930 --> 00:18:14.990
On the street over there...

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:21.900
So he <i>is</i> here...

00:18:22.340 --> 00:18:23.100
At last!

00:18:32.410 --> 00:18:35.080
Shit... it doesn't seem
to be moving at all.

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:42.590
We're getting nowhere at this rate.

00:18:44.130 --> 00:18:46.430
He couldn't have gone that far.

00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:47.590
Let's split up and search for him.

00:18:50.130 --> 00:18:51.190
We'll go this way.

00:18:52.530 --> 00:18:54.340
Kakyoin, you see to the vehicle.

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:55.200
R... right!

00:19:18.030 --> 00:19:19.080
Him...?

00:19:30.740 --> 00:19:33.000
"The gun is mightier than the sword," eh?

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:37.570
It's a nice saying.

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:38.770
No...

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:41.370
He's not... the one.

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:44.280
Hey...

00:19:44.720 --> 00:19:46.690
Who the hell are you!?

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:50.490
My name is Hol Horse.

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:53.890
I control the Stand that
represents "The Emperor" card.

00:19:54.430 --> 00:19:56.790
I don't give a damn about you.

00:19:57.430 --> 00:20:00.490
I'm looking for a man whose
hands are both right hands.

00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:02.900
What a selfish guy!

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:05.110
You asked, so I introduced myself!

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:06.600
Well, never mind.

00:20:06.740 --> 00:20:08.000
I came with him, anyway.

00:20:08.240 --> 00:20:09.400
He should be around.

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:11.270
What?

00:20:13.110 --> 00:20:13.980
Where?

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:15.980
Where is he!?

00:20:20.020 --> 00:20:20.780
Hey!

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:23.880
I don't have time to waste
on a little shit like you...

00:20:24.330 --> 00:20:25.380
so tell me where he is!

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:30.690
You...

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:32.700
What's so funny?

00:20:35.740 --> 00:20:37.290
Lord Dio told me...

00:20:37.740 --> 00:20:39.340
"That guy, Polnareff..."

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:41.310
"has a habit of under-
estimating his enemy..."

00:20:41.310 --> 00:20:43.070
"so it's easy to beat him."

00:20:43.910 --> 00:20:46.680
That really is true, so I had to laugh.

00:20:47.420 --> 00:20:48.470
What!?

00:20:50.820 --> 00:20:54.780
If I have to beat you to meet him,
well, you give me no choice, then.

00:20:56.820 --> 00:20:58.290
As you wish...

00:21:03.830 --> 00:21:04.700
It can't be...

00:21:06.230 --> 00:21:07.670
Don't do anything rash, Polnareff!!

00:21:14.810 --> 00:21:16.570
No need to rush things.

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:18.180
Hey, Polnareff...

00:21:19.110 --> 00:21:21.380
Do you know the game
called, "Soldier's Chess?"

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:24.480
"Soldier's Chess...?"

00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:27.120
The tank is stronger than the soldier...

00:21:27.120 --> 00:21:28.780
but weaker than the mine.

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:34.290
Well, it's a game based on the fundamental
principles of battle, such as that.

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:37.890
In the case of Hol Horse's
"Emperor" and you...

00:21:38.330 --> 00:21:41.960
the following rule applies perfectly:

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:44.060
That is...

00:21:44.310 --> 00:21:46.570
"The gun is mightier than the sword."

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:49.870
You... just what are you getting at?

00:21:50.310 --> 00:21:52.280
My Stand is the gun.

00:21:52.510 --> 00:21:54.670
So, your sword can't beat my gun.

00:21:55.620 --> 00:21:56.670
What?

00:21:56.920 --> 00:21:58.380
Beat your BUM?

00:21:58.520 --> 00:22:00.180
You crack me up!

00:22:23.410 --> 00:22:24.380
You...!

00:22:25.210 --> 00:22:26.370
I'll fucking kill you!

00:22:36.520 --> 00:22:38.290
You underestimated me, Polnareff!

00:22:38.530 --> 00:22:39.790
You lose!

00:22:48.400 --> 00:22:52.110
You think I can't strike
down a bullet like that!?

00:22:52.110 --> 00:22:53.370
Piece of cake!

00:22:54.410 --> 00:22:56.380
Silver Chariot!

00:23:04.020 --> 00:23:04.680
What?

00:23:04.920 --> 00:23:05.580
It can't be...!

00:23:05.820 --> 00:23:07.290
It changed directions...!

00:23:07.520 --> 00:23:09.580
Even the bullet is part of my Stand.

00:23:09.820 --> 00:23:10.980
You took me too lightly.

00:23:11.230 --> 00:23:13.430
You didn't expect that, and too bad...

00:23:13.430 --> 00:23:14.890
it's gonna cost you your life!

00:23:24.410 --> 00:23:25.570
<i>Avd</i>o<i>l!? </i>

00:23:29.310 --> 00:23:30.280
What!?

00:23:35.320 --> 00:23:36.180
Avdol!

00:23:36.320 --> 00:23:38.790
I came after you because I was
worried, and just look at this mess!

00:23:38.920 --> 00:23:40.480
W... worried!?

00:23:41.120 --> 00:23:43.490
The enemy knows
everything about us!

00:23:43.920 --> 00:23:46.190
You said you had
fought this far all alone...

00:23:46.430 --> 00:23:48.590
but from now on, you
can't win by yourself!

00:23:48.930 --> 00:23:50.690
W... why, you!

00:23:51.030 --> 00:23:52.500
Still lecturing me...!

00:23:52.730 --> 00:23:54.170
Well, well...

00:23:56.000 --> 00:23:58.470
What a time to interfere...

00:23:59.210 --> 00:23:59.970
But...

00:24:01.310 --> 00:24:02.670
Out of the way, Polnareff!

00:24:02.910 --> 00:24:04.170
The bullet is returning!

00:24:05.210 --> 00:24:07.480
It's a bullet he can control at will!

00:24:10.520 --> 00:24:13.080
You might be able to avoid
a sword, but how about this?

00:24:13.320 --> 00:24:14.480
I will burn it down!

00:24:14.620 --> 00:24:16.180
Magician's Red!

00:24:24.030 --> 00:24:24.900
Avdol-san!

00:24:44.720 --> 00:24:45.280
The...

00:24:45.520 --> 00:24:46.720
The bullet!

00:24:46.720 --> 00:24:47.690
Avdol-san!

00:25:12.210 --> 00:25:12.970
Old man!

00:25:14.210 --> 00:25:15.770
What is it, Jotaro?

00:25:18.620 --> 00:25:20.590
I have a bad feeling...

00:25:39.610 --> 00:25:40.470
Ho...

00:25:40.810 --> 00:25:42.570
This is fortunate.

00:25:43.110 --> 00:25:45.670
My gun and J. Gail's mirror...

00:25:45.810 --> 00:25:48.180
don't get along with Avdol's flames!

00:25:48.420 --> 00:25:49.970
How lucky!

00:25:50.420 --> 00:25:51.880
In this game of "Soldier's Chess,"

00:25:52.020 --> 00:25:54.180
there are no pieces left
we should beware of!

00:25:57.930 --> 00:25:58.980
Avdol-san!

00:26:01.730 --> 00:26:02.290
It...

00:26:02.430 --> 00:26:03.590
It can't be...

00:26:10.300 --> 00:26:12.070
Wake up, Avdol-san...

00:26:12.710 --> 00:26:14.140
Open your eyes, please!

00:26:18.510 --> 00:26:20.170
How pathetic...

00:26:20.310 --> 00:26:23.480
You liked to lecture others too
much, and look what happened.

00:26:27.120 --> 00:26:28.590
W... what?

00:26:28.720 --> 00:26:30.090
Polnareff...

00:26:30.920 --> 00:26:33.690
Avdol-san, to save you, he...

00:26:36.030 --> 00:26:38.400
Who asked him to save me?

00:26:38.730 --> 00:26:40.760
Such a meddlesome busybody...

00:26:41.600 --> 00:26:44.070
A guy like him becomes a drag...

00:26:44.400 --> 00:26:46.670
That's why I told you that
I wanted to do this alone.

00:26:48.710 --> 00:26:50.070
Polnareff...

00:26:50.310 --> 00:26:52.970
Do you know what you're saying?

00:27:03.520 --> 00:27:05.190
It's annoying...

00:27:10.230 --> 00:27:12.600
Dying near me...

00:27:12.730 --> 00:27:14.930
is SO damned annoying!
